35,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"Previous call-backs reduced readmissions, but home visits are often missed due to access issues.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"The facility is at capacity. Parking and rooms are full, and the booking system ignores non-appointment work.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Joint clinics have failed here due to budget disputes, and external data agreements take over a year.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Yumi,,"Ward nursing is struggling with vacancies, but the midwifery rota actually has some slack.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Servas,,"Our budget is smaller this year, and notably, off-site contacts bring in no regional funding.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Servas, if off-site work earns nothing, the Home Follow-Up Team seems financially risky.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Asuka, and the booking system would likely fail to track those visits anyway.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Yumi, the midwifery slack is interesting. Perhaps a program there wouldn't strain the rosters?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Yumi,,I hadn't thought of that! It might be a way to help without burning people out.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Servas,,Indeed. We must find a path that is both sustainable and fiscally responsible.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Benjamin, would a joint program like the Perinatal service suffer the same fate as the previous joint clinic?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Toshio,,Only if the budget and rota responsibilities are not clearly defined from the start.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,Precisely. We must avoid the ambiguity that killed the last joint venture.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Yumi,,"If the midwives have space, they might be happy to lead it!","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Servas,,A positive spirit is the foundation of any successful service.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
