60,3,1,talk,Asuka,,"The candidates are Home Follow-Up, Perinatal Support, Day Rehab, and Chronic Care. I lean toward Perinatal.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Toshio,,Day Rehab and Chronic Care require too much space or external data links. Perinatal is safer.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,Chronic Care is a legal nightmare with those data agreements. Perinatal is the most logical choice.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Yumi,,I love the Perinatal idea! It uses the available staffing and helps new parents.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Servas,,"Perinatal Support is on-site, meaning it earns tariffs and fits our tighter budget.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Asuka,,"It avoids the ""invisible work"" problem of the Home Follow-Up team.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Toshio,,And it doesn't require new parking or shuttle expansions.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,As long as the midwifery and pediatric departments sign a clear agreement.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Yumi,,I'm sure they will if it helps the community!,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Servas,,"It is a gentle way to grow, respecting both our limits and our needs.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Asuka,,I am satisfied with this choice.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Toshio,,I agree.,"{""words"":2,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,Agreed.,"{""words"":1,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Yumi,,Me too!,"{""words"":2,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Servas,,Then we have found our harmony.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
